affects economic development

00:27:59.700 --> 00:28:02.070
especially in developing countries.

00:28:02.070 --> 00:28:05.440
So, when a firm from a
developing country engages

00:28:05.440 --> 00:28:08.330
in international trade
where they throw imports

00:28:08.330 --> 00:28:10.840
of intermediate imports or exports

00:28:10.840 --> 00:28:14.430
with developed countries trade of firm.

00:28:15.440 --> 00:28:18.600
It typically upgrades the
quality of its products,

00:28:18.600 --> 00:28:22.166
technologies and management practices.

00:28:22.166 --> 00:28:25.578
Firms in developed countries
are generally more advanced,

00:28:25.578 --> 00:28:30.020
and there are several
reasons why they may want

00:28:30.020 --> 00:28:32.870
their trading partners to also
upgrade that their quality.

00:28:32.870 --> 00:28:35.840
For example, the automated
production process,

00:28:35.840 --> 00:28:39.550
typically requires precise
specification for ports,

00:28:39.550 --> 00:28:41.840
and higher quality materials.

00:28:41.840 --> 00:28:43.800
Just in time inventory management,

00:28:43.800 --> 00:28:47.700
and integrated computer systems
require trading partners

00:28:47.700 --> 00:28:51.200
to be organized and flexible
with their deliveries,

00:28:51.200 --> 00:28:54.460
billings, and even product
specifications after all,

00:28:54.460 --> 00:28:57.410
adapting to shocks is one
of the main advantages

00:28:57.410 --> 00:28:58.543
of just-in-time.

00:28:59.830 --> 00:29:03.180
This upgrading of quality among
the importers and exporters

00:29:03.180 --> 00:29:05.470
is well documented in the literature.

00:29:05.470 --> 00:29:09.570
What's less well known is
that for the same reasons

00:29:09.570 --> 00:29:12.360
the importers and
exporters as they upgrade,

00:29:12.360 --> 00:29:15.890
they also required their
trading partners domestically

00:29:15.890 --> 00:29:17.560
to upgrade.

00:29:17.560 --> 00:29:19.630
And these importers and exporters tend

00:29:19.630 --> 00:29:21.540
to be very large firms.

00:29:21.540 --> 00:29:24.210
And so, even a relatively small amount

00:29:24.210 --> 00:29:27.252
